## 2. Daily reset

**All data is deleted every day** at the reset time shown on every page: accounts, Game Requests, chat, follows, and everything else you enter. Everyone is signed out.

## 3. Administrator rights

Every signed-in player can grant themselves administrator rights. Some destructive or externally visible administrator actions are disabled. Do not abuse these rights.

## 4. Acceptable use

Do not impersonate others, harass anyone, post illegal, hateful, or sexually explicit content, spam, or interfere with the service. Everything you post is public to other demo visitors until the next reset.

